518
00:35:26.707 --> 00:35:27.792
Kamahalan!

519
00:35:27.875 --> 00:35:29.836
Mangyaring huminto!

520
00:35:30.378 --> 00:35:31.212
Ituloy ang pagbabasa.

521
00:35:36.300 --> 00:35:38.886
"Ang ikalabing-apat na araw ng ikaapat na buwan
sa Year of the Black Pig."

522
00:35:38.970 --> 00:35:41.139
"Ginawa ng Reyna Dowager ang kahilingan

523
00:35:41.848 --> 00:35:43.057
