576
00:39:11.766 --> 00:39:13.309
Tinanong ko kung totoo yun!

577
00:39:18.439 --> 00:39:19.357
Oo, Kamahalan.

578
00:39:39.293 --> 00:39:41.212
Ang damit na may bahid ng dugo…

579
00:39:43.923 --> 00:39:45.257
